# One regular expression per line. lychee reads this file from the repo root.

# GitLab draws the page headings in the browser, so lychee can't find these
# anchors in the HTML. Both headings exist in the README. Each entry matches
# one whole URL, so a misspelled anchor elsewhere on the project still fails.
^https://gitlab\.com/datarobot-oss/workload-deploy#restricted-networks$
^https://gitlab\.com/datarobot-oss/workload-deploy#troubleshooting$
